#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0330 expect=noViolation domain=ADVS
#note "BASECA1N is not declared. The absent column is the TARGET here, so the operator short-circuits to no violations while the guard not empty(BASECAT1) stays true: EXECUTED and silent. Mirror of AD0329's degraded-key fixture."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADVS class=BDS
col STUDYID  type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col PARAMCD  type=Char
col BASECAT1 type=Char
---
S1 | 001 | SYSBP | NORMAL
S1 | 002 | SYSBP | NORMAL
S1 | 003 | SYSBP | HIGH
